<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Bundled Communications for Healthcare: Better Scheduling, Reminders, and Call Routing\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/improving-patient-calls-scheduling-healthcare-bundles\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Many healthcare organizations still rely on separate systems for phones, scheduling, messaging, and network infrastructure. That setup creates gaps across every interaction. Bundled communications brings these systems together into one managed environment, helping teams operate with more clarity and fewer points of failure.\\u00a0 What Bundled Communications Means in Healthcare\\u00a0 Bundled communications combines voice, contact center, [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/improving-patient-calls-scheduling-healthcare-bundles\\/\\\">Bundled Communications for Healthcare: Better Scheduling, Reminders, and Call Routing<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why Healthcare IT Leaders Are Consolidating UCaaS and Network Providers\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/healthcare-consolidating-ucaas-network-providers\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Healthcare IT leaders are under pressure to keep systems running at all times. Patient care depends on it. A dropped call or frozen video during a telehealth visit is not just a minor issue. It can disrupt care, delay decisions, and put trust at risk.\\u00a0 This is why many organizations are moving away from separate [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/healthcare-consolidating-ucaas-network-providers\\/\\\">Why Healthcare IT Leaders Are Consolidating UCaaS and Network Providers<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"How Bundled Communications Improve Patient and Staff Call Reliability\\u00a0\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/how-bundled-communications-improve-patient-and-staff-call-reliability\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Bundled communications bring voice, networking, security, and infrastructure together into a single, coordinated system. For healthcare providers, this improves call reliability for both patients and staff by reducing downtime, simplifying support, and ensuring every layer works together.\\u00a0 When communication systems are unified instead of pieced together, hospitals and clinics can deliver more consistent care, faster [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/how-bundled-communications-improve-patient-and-staff-call-reliability\\/\\\">How Bundled Communications Improve Patient and Staff Call Reliability\\u00a0<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Practical Ways Partners are Bundling Managed Services with UCaaS\\u00a0\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/practical-ways-partners-are-bundling-managed-services-with-ucaas\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Growth tends to expose the cracks in technology environments. A phone system lives in one place; networking sits with another provider; security comes from somewhere else. Each piece works, but managing them together becomes a daily exercise in coordination.\\u00a0 Partners are seeing this challenge across retail, hospitality, and other multi-location businesses. Instead of solving each [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/practical-ways-partners-are-bundling-managed-services-with-ucaas\\/\\\">Practical Ways Partners are Bundling Managed Services with UCaaS\\u00a0<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"How a Healthcare UCaaS Bundle Improves Hospital Communications and Patient Care\\u00a0\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/healthcare-ucaas-bundle-hospital-communications-platform\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>A healthcare UCaaS bundle is an integrated healthcare communications platform that combines voice, video, messaging, contact center, managed networks for healthcare providers, and security into one managed solution. It supports hospitals, clinics, and multi-site practices that need secure, reliable communication connected directly to patient systems like EHRs. By consolidating the hospital phone system, managed firewall [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/healthcare-ucaas-bundle-hospital-communications-platform\\/\\\">How a Healthcare UCaaS Bundle Improves Hospital Communications and Patient Care\\u00a0<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Bundled Communications for Hotel Resorts: A More Connected Way to Run Hospitality\\u00a0\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/bundled-communications-hotel-resorts\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Bundled communications for hotel resorts bring together hotel phone systems, managed networks for hotels, security, Wi-Fi, and property integrations into one connected platform. Phones are no longer just devices on a desk. They are unified communications platforms that support voice, messaging, mobile access, and daily operations across the property. When these systems are bundled, resorts [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/bundled-communications-hotel-resorts\\/\\\">Bundled Communications for Hotel Resorts: A More Connected Way to Run Hospitality\\u00a0<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Phone Bundles for Hotels: What They Are and Why They Matter\\u00a0\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/phone-bundles-for-hotels\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Phone bundles for hotels combine a hospitality phone system, business phone and internet, managed network services, and security into one integrated solution. Instead of managing separate vendors for UCaaS, firewalls, switches, Wi-Fi, and PMS integrations, hotels deploy a unified communications platform designed specifically for multi-property hotel communications. This approach improves uptime, protects payment data, and [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/phone-bundles-for-hotels\\/\\\">Phone Bundles for Hotels: What They Are and Why They Matter\\u00a0<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why Hospitality IT Teams Prefer Bundled Communications Providers\\u00a0\\u00a0\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/why-hospitality-it-teams-prefer-bundled-communications-providers\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Bundled communications providers give hospitality IT teams one place to manage the hotel phone system, messaging, and managed networks for hotels. Instead of working across multiple vendors and platforms, everything operates as one connected hospitality IT solution. This makes it easier to support staff, respond to guest needs faster, and maintain reliable communication across properties. [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/why-hospitality-it-teams-prefer-bundled-communications-providers\\/\\\">Why Hospitality IT Teams Prefer Bundled Communications Providers\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"How to Switch From On-Prem PBX: A Practical Migration Guide\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/how-to-switch-from-on-premises-pbx\\/\",\"content\":\"\\n<p>Your on-premises PBX has been the backbone of your business communications for years \\u2014 maybe decades. It works\\u2026 mostly. But somewhere between the last emergency firmware patch, the technician who\\u2019s the only person who understands the wiring closet, and the growing list of features your team keeps requesting that your legacy system simply can\\u2019t deliver, [\\u2026]<\\/p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/blog\\/how-to-switch-from-on-premises-pbx\\/\\\">How to Switch From On-Prem PBX: A Practical Migration Guide<\\/a> appeared first on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sangoma.com\\/\\\">Sangoma Technologies<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\"}]}'),('518cc420-dab2-4de3-b8e7-bdb8f2a06fd4','json-arr','{\"psi.@attributes.xmlns:tns\":\"http:\\/\\/phpsysinfo.sourceforge.net\\/\",\"psi.@attributes.xmlns:xsi\":\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2001\\/XMLSchema-instance\",\"psi.@attributes.xsi:schemaLocation\":\"http:\\/\\/phpsysinfo.sourceforge.net\\/ phpsysinfo3.xsd\",\"psi.Generation.@attributes.version\":\"3.1.11\",\"psi.Options.@attributes.tempFormat\":\"c\",\"psi.Options.@attributes.byteFormat\":\"auto_binary\",\"psi.Options.@attributes.showPickListTemplate\":\"true\",\"psi.Options.@attributes.showPickListLang\":\"true\",\"psi.UsedPlugins.Plugin.0.@attributes.name\":\"mdstatus\",\"psi.UsedPlugins.Plugin.1.@attributes.name\":\"smart\",\"psi.UsedPlugins.Plugin.2.@attributes.name\":\"ipmiinfo\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.Hostname\":\"37ddd19d3442\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.IPAddr\":\"172.19.0.2\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.Kernel\":\"6.19.10-1-cachyos (SMP) x86_64\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.Distro\":\"Debian GNU\\/Linux 10 (buster)\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.Distroicon\":\"Debian.png\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.LoadAvg\":\"2.77 1.63 0.85\",\"psi.Vitals.@attributes.OS\":\"Linux\",\"psi.Network.NetDevice.0.@attributes.Name\":\"lo\",\"psi.Network.NetDevice.0.@attributes.Info\":\"127.0.0.1;::1\",\"psi.Network.NetDevice.1.@attributes.Name\":\"eth0\",\"psi.Network.NetDevice.1.@attributes.Info\":\"172.19.0.2;32-89-8d-bb-58-68\",\"psi.Hardware.PCI.Device.0.@attributes.Name\":\"Host bridge: Intel Corporation Device a702\",\"psi.Hardware.PCI.Device.1.@attributes.Name\":\"PCI bridge: Intel Corporation Device a70d\",\"psi.Hardware.PCI.Device.2.@attributes.Name\":\"Signal processing contro